  "content": "\n\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/sJXpRfY/Mining-Logo-2.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"120\"></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">Описание:</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Добавляет многоблочные буры и перерабатывающие машины.</span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/MD6MFxJ/Mining-Logo-3.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\"></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/M1nKbZH/Mining-Logo-4.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"446\"></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">Инструкция:</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yiwpVEei_oM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></h4>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">Совместимость:</span></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">Моды:</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- Immersive Engineering</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- Mekanism</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- Thermal Expansion</span></p>\n<hr></div>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&#x27;arial black&#x27;, sans-serif\">Мои моды:</span></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multipart-machines-grinding\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/drp1ksq/Logo-1-Grinding.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128